        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 800AT, Ornate Amherst Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>A Single cylinder is operated by key outside, turn knob inside. This Amherst Kwikset handleset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this handle set is that the decorative grip will never go out of style; a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years. The Kwikset Amherst handleset is solid brass construction with a Lifetime Warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/amherst-double-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-801at\"><b>Amherst Double Cylinder Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/amherst-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802at\"><b>Amherst Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> for the Amherst Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Kwikset SmartKey lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li> Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the 800AT Amherst Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<!-- <li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>  -->\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 18-23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing:  5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt:  8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The deadbolt on this single cylinder handleset is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><i>The inside trim finish will match the exterior handleset finish that you choose.</i></p>",
